<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:34:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>通过印刷细菌晶体管制成的活电路板</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/living-circuit-boards-built-by-printing-bacterial-transistors</link><description>它指向了一个计算不一定局限于硅的未来。相反，我们可以用活细胞制成的“电路板”本身来构建能够感知、交流、计算和响应的活材料。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/living-circuit-boards-built-by-printing-bacterial-transistors.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:34:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/living-circuit-boards-built-by-printing-bacterial-transistors</guid></item><item><title>切割光子的尾巴</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cutting-the-tail-of-a-photon</link><description>理论家说，在单个光子反射过程中移除镜子会产生无数光子的量子态。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cutting-the-tail-of-a-photon.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:19:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cutting-the-tail-of-a-photon</guid></item><item><title>SLAC 研究人员开发基于人工智能的工具来压缩数据而不丢失细节</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/slac-researchers-develop-aibased-tool-to-compress-data-without-losing-detail</link><description>新颖的神经网络将使存储和检索来自各个科学领域实验的大量原始数据变得更加容易。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/slac-researchers-develop-aibased-tool-to-compress-data-without-losing-detail3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:04:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/slac-researchers-develop-aibased-tool-to-compress-data-without-losing-detail</guid></item><item><title>绘制钍的首选位置可以为核钟铺平道路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mapping-thoriums-preferred-sites-could-pave-the-way-for-nuclear-clocks</link><description>几十年来，物理学家一直使用一种称为穆斯堡尔光谱的技术来观察固体材料的内部，通过研究原子核如何吸收和重新发射伽马射线来揭示其周围环境的细节。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mapping-thoriums-preferred-sites-could-pave-the-way-for-nuclear-clocks2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:49:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mapping-thoriums-preferred-sites-could-pave-the-way-for-nuclear-clocks</guid></item><item><title>陨石尘埃中的磁性记录可能有助于太阳的形成</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/meteorite-dust-holds-records-of-magnetism-that-may-have-helped-form-the-sun</link><description>46 亿年前，太阳系只不过是一个由气体和尘埃组成的巨大球体。在接下来的几百万年里，这个“太阳星云”经历了巨大的转变，变平成一个物质盘，然后凝聚形成中央太阳和绕轨道运行的行星。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/meteorite-dust-holds-records-of-magnetism-that-may-have-helped-form-the-sun.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:34:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/meteorite-dust-holds-records-of-magnetism-that-may-have-helped-form-the-sun</guid></item><item><title>南极冰层下捕获的单个中微子让天文学家跨越 110 亿光年寻找一个绰号为“影子冲击波”的年轻星系，它的光线被位于它和地球之间的另一个星系弯曲和放大</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-single-neutrino-caught-beneath-the-antarctic-ice-sent-astronomers-searching-across-11-billion-lightyears-them-to-a-young-galaxy-nicknamed-the-shadow-blaster-its-light-bent-and-magnified-by-another</link><description>750 TeV IceCube 警报使天文学家发现了红移 2.988 处罕见的透镜状尘埃星暴。该星系是该领域的最佳候选者，但尚未得到证实的中微子源。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-single-neutrino-caught-beneath-the-antarctic-ice-sent-astronomers-searching-across-11-billion-lightyears-them-to-a-young-galaxy-nicknamed-the-shadow-blaster-its-light-bent-and-magnified-by-another.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:19:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-single-neutrino-caught-beneath-the-antarctic-ice-sent-astronomers-searching-across-11-billion-lightyears-them-to-a-young-galaxy-nicknamed-the-shadow-blaster-its-light-bent-and-magnified-by-another</guid></item><item><title>肺癌患者接受亚硒酸盐治疗后肿瘤消失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/lung-cancer-patient-became-tumourfree-after-treatment-with-selenite</link><description>一位患有晚期难治性肺癌的患者在接受硒化合物亚硒酸盐治疗后，肿瘤消失了。卡罗林斯卡大学医院和卡罗林斯卡学院的一项新研究以病例报告的形式发表在《肿瘤与治疗》杂志上，这表明了这一点。这些发现可能有助于增加人们对亚硒酸盐作为一种可能的癌症治疗方法的认识。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/lung-cancer-patient-became-tumourfree-after-treatment-with-selenite.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:04:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/lung-cancer-patient-became-tumourfree-after-treatment-with-selenite</guid></item><item><title>有争议的理论表明，地球具有意识，具有塑造所有生命命运的“思想”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/planet-earth-is-conscious-with-a-mind-shaping-the-fate-of-all-life-controversial-theory-suggests</link><description>如果地球是一个能够智能调节生命条件的超级有机体，那么人类就可以成为其总体规划的一部分。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/planet-earth-is-conscious-with-a-mind-shaping-the-fate-of-all-life-controversial-theory-suggests.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:49:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/planet-earth-is-conscious-with-a-mind-shaping-the-fate-of-all-life-controversial-theory-suggests</guid></item><item><title>Unitree 机器狗如何将美国军事研究变成 1,600 美元的产品</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-unitree-robot-dogs-turned-us-military-research-into-a-1600-product</link><description>Unitree 的主导产品 Go2 机器狗售价为 1,600 美元，其核心腿部执行器设计可追溯到 DARPA 以及麻省理工学院和宾夕法尼亚大学美国陆军研究实验室资助的四足动物研究。一位研究人员发表的关于执行器设计的硕士论文在六个月内就被中国制造商复制。 Unitree 的创始人在他自己 2016 年的论文中直接引用了麻省理工学院的同一项研究。技术转让不是盗窃。这是开放学术出版与能够比原始资助者更快商业化的制造基地发生冲突的可预见的结果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-unitree-robot-dogs-turned-us-military-research-into-a-1600-product2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:34:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-unitree-robot-dogs-turned-us-military-research-into-a-1600-product</guid></item><item><title>测试发现 85% 的日常个人护理产品含有未标记的化学物质，疑似危害健康</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/testing-finds-85-of-everyday-personal-care-products-contain-unlabeled-chemicals-with-suspected-health-hazards</link><description>一项针对防晒霜、婴儿乳液、洗发水、肥皂和其他日常产品的新研究发现，几乎所有产品都含有标签上未披露的化学物质。大多数产品至少含有一种未标记的已知或疑似健康危害的化学物质，四分之一的产品含有与包装上的声明相矛盾的化学物质，包括含有邻苯二甲酸盐的“不含邻苯二甲酸盐”产品。该研究发表在《环境与健康》杂志上。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/testing-finds-85-of-everyday-personal-care-products-contain-unlabeled-chemicals-with-suspected-health-hazards2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:19:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/testing-finds-85-of-everyday-personal-care-products-contain-unlabeled-chemicals-with-suspected-health-hazards</guid></item></channel></rss>